{
  "key": 37906,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_WantMeToRateNicknames",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, hello!\n",
        "I am the official Name Rater!\r",
        "Want me to rate the nicknames of\n",
        "your Pokémon?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bonjour, bonjour!\n",
        "Je suis le Spécialiste des Noms!\r",
        "Tu veux que j’évalue le surnom\n",
        "de tes Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_CritiqueWhichNickname",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon’s nickname should\n",
        "I critique?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quel est le Pokémon dont je dois\n",
        "évaluer le surnom?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_GiveItABetterName",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, is it?\n",
        "That’s a decent nickname!\r",
        "But would you like to give it\n",
        "an even better name?\r",
        "How about it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, c’est ça?\n",
        "C’est un surnom acceptable!\r",
        "Mais que dirais-tu de lui trouver\n",
        "un nom encore meilleur?\r",
        "Alors, ça te dit?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_WhatShallNewNicknameBe",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, good. Then, what shall the new\n",
        "nickname be?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ah, très bien. Alors, quel est son\n",
        "nouveau surnom?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_BetterNameThanBefore",
      "en_US": [
        "Done! From now on, this Pokémon\n",
        "shall be known as {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!\r",
        "It is a better name than before!\n",
        "How fortunate for you!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Et voilà! Dorénavant, ce Pokémon sera\n",
        "connu sous le nom de {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Ce nom est beaucoup mieux qu’avant!\n",
        "Tu as fait le bon choix!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_PleaseComeVisitAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "I see.\n",
        "Please come visit again."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je vois.\n",
        "N’hésite pas à revenir me voir."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_NoDifferentFromBefore",
      "en_US": [
        "Done! From now on, this Pokémon\n",
        "shall be known as {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!\r",
        "It looks no different from before,\n",
        "and yet, this is vastly superior!\r",
        "How fortunate for you!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Et voilà! Dorénavant, ce Pokémon sera\n",
        "connu sous le nom de {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!\r",
        "On ne dirait pas comme ça, mais\n",
        "ce nom est bien meilleur!\r",
        "Tu as fait le bon choix!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_TrulyImpeccableName",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, is it?\n",
        "That is a truly impeccable name!\r",
        "Take good care of {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, c’est ça?\n",
        "Ce nom est impeccable!\r",
        "Prends bien soin de {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_CantNicknameEgg",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, now. That is merely an Egg!\n",
        "An Egg can go by no other name!\n"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Allons... C’est encore un Oeuf! Un\n",
        "Oeuf, c’est un Oeuf et puis c’est tout!\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_AskTradeBuizelForChatot",
      "en_US": [
        "Excuse me, but do you got that\n",
        "Pokémon named BUIZEL?\r",
        "Wanna trade it for my CHATOT?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Excuse-moi, tu n’aurais pas le\n",
        "Pokémon nommé MUSTEBOUEE?\r",
        "Tu me l’échanges contre un PIJAKO?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_YesSoAwesomeABuizel",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes! So awesome! A BUIZEL!\n",
        "I so promise I’ll be good to it!\r",
        "Oh yeah, CHATOT can learn some human\n",
        "speech pretty quickly.\r",
        "Try out its move Chatter.\n",
        "You’ll totally see what I mean."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ouais! Trop génial! Un MUSTEBOUEE!\n",
        "Juré, j’en prendrai bien soin!\r",
        "Ah oui, un PIJAKO peut apprendre à\n",
        "parler notre langue très rapidement.\r",
        "Essaie sa capacité Babil.\n",
        "Tu comprendras tout de suite."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_IWantBuizel",
      "en_US": "What I totally want is a BUIZEL...",
      "fr_FR": "J’ai tellement envie d’un MUSTEBOUEE..."
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_OhOKTotallyGotIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, OK. Totally got it.\n",
        "It’s all right if you don’t want to.\r",
        "But if you change your mind,\n",
        "let’s totally trade some Pokémon."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, d’accord, pigé.\n",
        "Tu fais comme tu veux, hein.\r",
        "Mais si tu changes d’avis, je serai là\n",
        "pour échanger des Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_DidChatotLearnChatter",
      "en_US": [
        "Did that CHATOT I traded you totally\n",
        "learn that Chatter move?\r",
        "It will mimic your speech if you use\n",
        "that move outside of battle.\r",
        "It’ll forget any speech you taught it\n",
        "if you stick it in a PC Box, though."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Est-ce que le PIJAKO que je t’ai\n",
        "échangé a appris la capacité Babil?\r",
        "Il imite ta voix quand tu l’utilises\n",
        "en dehors du combat.\r",
        "Par contre, si tu le mets dans une\n",
        "Boîte du PC, il oubliera tous les mots\f",
        "appris précédemment."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_ImBuildingSuperintented",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi! I’m the building superintendent.\n",
        "I maintain a vigilant 24-hour watch!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut! Je suis le directeur du\n",
        "bâtiment. Je suis de garde 24h/24!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums1F_Text_Mantain24HourWatchZzz",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m...building...superintendent...\n",
        "...maintain...24-hour watch... Zzz..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Chuis... directeur... bâtiment...\n",
        "... de garde... 24h/24... Zzz..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}